  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Original Mod for Starsector by:<br>SAVEmedley and 死萌 (Simeng)</p><p>0.96 Version<br><a href=\"https://github.com/MycophobiaSC/mimikko_tl/releases/download/v.07/mimikko096.tl.0.7.rar\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/MycophobiaSC/mimikko_tl/releases/download/v.07/mimikko096.tl.0.7.rar</a></p><p>0.97 Mod Info Edit, not extensively tested but should work no problem (I might have gotten the wrong mod.info, will correct tonight once I’m home)<br><a href=\"https://github.com/MycophobiaSC/mimikko_tl/releases/download/v.07-97/mimikko096.tl.0.7.-.0.97.rar\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/MycophobiaSC/mimikko_tl/releases/download/v.07-97/mimikko096.tl.0.7.-.0.97.rar</a><br>(TL Update Mar 5-2024 v0.5)<br>Dependencies:<br>Lazy Lib/Magic Lib/Graphic Lib</p><p>There is a known issue that can break saves that can sometime be triggered by making one of Nonona’s skill elite(it will happen sometime after the skill is made elite). This does not always happen but we suggest you making multiple save to be sure. Since many assistant are seeing rework next patch that will likely fix this issue, and we aren’t able to pin point the cause, there will not be a hot fix for this issue.</p><p>Safe to add mid-save but some unique salvage are generated at sector gen and will only be available in a new game.</p><p>If playing with Nexerelin, the randomized sector option will make most assistants unobtainable (it is fine to use Nex, there is a unique start to go with it, just avoid randomized sector)</p>",
